  dialogues:
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "This grandma of yours. She\u2019s kind of your village leader?"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "We don\u2019t really use that term, but in a sense, yes."
    - "It was her mother who sort of brought Sk\xE4rstad together, so grandma naturally
      took on that role after her."
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
